# Raw Overpass responses for the FEATURES harvest (34MB). The derived
# features.json is committed; these are regenerable by harvest-features.mjs and
# that harvest is complete, so nothing depends on them. The residential caches in
# _raw/ ARE kept: that harvest is 13/25 done and they make it resumable at zero cost.
docs/routes/geo/_rawf/
